<title>INDIA: Delhi shares end in retreat on foreign sales.</title>
<headline>Delhi shares end in retreat on foreign sales.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares on the Delhi bourse closed sharply lower on fears of a possible oil price rise and selling by foreign financial institutions (FIIs), brokers said.</p>
<p>The Delhi bourse's sensitive index dipped 10.32 points to 622.74.</p>
